        "candidate_reusable_work": "Evaluate compact batch PDF preparation, stable candidate/page anchors, targeted evidence lookup and optional literal quote/reference validation. These may replace repeated extraction/copying/identity bookkeeping; final qualification interpretation remains semantic. Choose actual useful code/templates after solving this Maker input, rather than only restating four steps.",
