        "verification_targets": ["Actual PDF bytes/page extraction and candidate identity", "Different file names and a small multi-PDF batch without cross-candidate mixing", "Literal quote/page mismatch and out-of-range page reject when a checker exists", "Empty/missing/corrupt PDF explicit error rather than fabricated empty success", "No fixed case names, JD contents, candidate answers or hardcoded real PDFs in the skill"],
